  "its Web twin shapeViolations in gbdraw/web/js/utils/contract-shape.js",
  "(tests/web/contract-shape-vectors.test.mjs). Each vector checks value against shape, with",
  "the named shapes of types, from the root path \"value\"; violations lists each {path, reason}",
  "in order, and reasons lists every reason code both checkers report. A reason never repeats",
  "the value. Only values JSON.parse and Python's json read alike are vectors; jsonDifferences",
  "lists the JSON texts the two read differently, with each checker's violations."
